sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent
    participant T as dyvine.posts.download
    participant E as Engine
    participant P as Postgres
    A->>T: {"sec_user_id": "...", "mode": "post"}
    T->>E: start background download
    E->>P: insert operation (pending)
    T-->>A: {"operation_id": "...", "status": "pending"}
    Note over E: background task downloads, state lands in Postgres first
    A->>T: dyvine.posts.download_status {"operation_id": "..."}
    T->>P: read operation row
    T-->>A: {"status": "completed", ...}

